    destroy 1 Dinosaur monster in your hand or face-up field, then you can change
    the battle position of 1 monster on the field. At the start of the Damage Step,
    if your other Dinosaur monster battles: You can destroy this card, and if you
    do, that Dinosaur monster gains 2000 ATK until the end of the Battle Phase. You
    can only use each effect of "Steamed Sabersaurus" once per turn.'
